  "request": "I need you to create a proposal. I had thought we had a validation when running the cmd-poller (once or nightliy) to avoid saving duplicated records for the same captured date. I mean, If I run the cmd-poller-once twice, The second attempted should either not be saved or replace the existing one. THere should be only one record per captured date on the vehicle snapshots table. Can that be fixed?",
